ind":"update","title":"Demo 0.2.4 Update Notes - Challenge Mode Now Live","summary":"New FeaturesAdded Challenge Mode. It becomes available after completing the main story levels.OptimizationsOptimized the initial placement of puzzle pieces.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T14:51:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930003","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4919570-1841579228667724","game_id":"steam-4919570","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.1.26 Update Notes","summary":"New FeaturesAdded a border guide feature for the full image — you can now choose whether to show or hide the border based on your preference.OptimizationsUpdated the tutorial content to include guidance for the new border guide feature.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T07:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667724","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4919570-1840310314340265","game_id":"steam-4919570","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.1.25 Update Notes","summary":"OptimizationsImproved the completion effect when a cat archive is successfully restored.FixesFixed puzzle piece snapping issues in certain situations.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T21:40:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340265","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4919570-1840310314338913","game_id":"steam-4919570","kind":"announcement","title":"\"Bedtime Story\" Replaced – Extra Efforts for Creator Copyright Safety","summary":"Hello, players and creators of Meow Star Archives!We've just made an important audio resource update and would like to share the details with you.About This Update: We have proactively replaced the background track \"Bedtime Story\" (which was already properly licensed) with \"Juillet\" by Monplaisir. This is a CC0 (Public Domain) track, which means it is completely free to use, modify, and share worldwide, with no attribution required.Why We Made This Change: After testing, we found that although \"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T11:11:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338913","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4919570-1839676055897619","game_id":"steam-4919570","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.1.22 Update Notes","summary":"OptimizationsImproved the UI style of the Cat CD Player.Enhanced the display of the sidebar — now adapts to different wallpaper colors.FixesFixed a rare black screen issue that could occur when switching scenes.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T15:13:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055897619","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4919570-1839676055889344","game_id":"steam-4919570","kind":"announcement","title":"Meow Star Archives Demo is Out Now！","summary":"Hello everyone, our demo is finally here!Play it now!As a cat lover, this game is my love letter to all the furry little souls in the world.And it's my message to anyone who's ever had to say goodbye to a cat:As long as you remember them, they will always be with you.Demo ContentEstimated playtime: approx. 30–60 minutes2 cat archives (10 levels)If you love cute cats and cozy puzzle games, we would be truly grateful if you could add it to your wishlist. Thank you so much!Bug Reports & Feedback: m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T21:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055889344","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4919570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4919570":"2026-10-26T05:12:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4919570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4928930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4919570","app_id":4919570,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"6471db5ef4622f4be61d58a89ea87bcdc58e03de042d04113860a3ef51af613d","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"독창적인 손그림 일러스트 퍼즐 게임 속에서, 손상된 고양이 기억 기록을 복원해 영혼이 소멸하는 것을 막으세요. 아카이브를 복구하는 동안, 이 사랑스러운 고양이들이 별로 돌아가기 전에 어떤 이야기를 간직하고 있었는지도 알게 됩니다! 타이머도 압박도 없어요. 조각이 제자리에 맞춰질 때의 그 만족감과, 귀여운 고양이들과 함께하는 포근한 시간을 즐기세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Mio_Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Mio_Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1795770000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Meow Star Archives pv-en","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792783548","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4919570/80